          "english_quote": "If the shepherds themselves are ruined, what answer will they give for this flock?[c]",
          "issue": "The simplified edition omits reperti, “found.” The source frames the shepherds’ condition as something discovered in the assessment, continuing the preceding repeated language of finding the flock healthy or ruined. Merely being ruined does not fully preserve that assessment wording.",
          "suggested_revision": "Proposed correction for fresh review: “If the shepherds themselves are found ruined, what answer will they give for this flock?[c]”",
